{"4194080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HORSE CLUB Ride West", "steam_appid": 4194080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The HORSE CLUB is visiting the Wild River Ranch!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel with your friends Hannah, Sofia, Sarah, and Lisa to the Wild West. Explore the vast landscape, help old and new friends, experience exciting adventures on horseback, learn Western riding, test your skills, and claim the crown at the big Western riding tournament! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a lovingly crafted world and explore the adventurous surroundings at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a charming, engaging story full of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to classic riding disciplines like barrel racing and pole bending, you can also test your skills in activities such as archery, painting, and playing the guitar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique horses are waiting to be ridden - each with its own character and traits that you can develop throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own style for you and your horse with numerous customization options and a wide selection of carefully designed color combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is accompanied by an atmospheric original soundtrack composed by Grammy®-winning musician Winifred Phillips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the HORSE CLUB Adventures series - Wild River Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the <i>HORSE CLUB</i> franchise by the German toy brand Schleich®</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The HORSE CLUB is visiting the Wild River Ranch!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel with your friends Hannah, Sofia, Sarah, and Lisa to the Wild West. Explore the vast landscape, help old and new friends, experience exciting adventures on horseback, learn Western riding, test your skills, and claim the crown at the big Western riding tournament! <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c62696489bf83140a8ee6989752cc7f1.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a lovingly crafted world and explore the adventurous surroundings at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/c7b674dbbf3ba6870d5a73fed146f720.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a charming, engaging story full of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/9bbf0ad2dda98a35b28ac9e04e5ebee9.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to classic riding disciplines like barrel racing and pole bending, you can also test your skills in activities such as archery, painting, and playing the guitar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/4eed922fa4693769ab1260f20c4341bd.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six unique horses are waiting to be ridden - each with its own character and traits that you can develop throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/e0366b449a75a8c64b7ab28de37f4d15.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own style for you and your horse with numerous customization options and a wide selection of carefully designed color combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.poster.avif?t=1782310570\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.webm?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4194080/extras/2eb7c6a103700a226170d4e9dedbc031.mp4?t=1782310570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is accompanied by an atmospheric original soundtrack composed by Grammy®-winning musician Winifred Phillips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the HORSE CLUB Adventures series - Wild River Games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the <i>HORSE CLUB</i> franchise by the German toy brand Schleich®</p>", "short_description": "The HORSE CLUB is visiting the Wild River Ranch! Travel with your friends Hannah, Sofia, Sarah, and Lisa to th